OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Mon 3 Aug to Wed 12 AugFIt
OL,6,Fwill probably become more changeable
OL,7,Ffor a time at least at the start of
OL,8,Fthis period. This means there is a
OL,9,Fgreater chance of some rain or showers
OL,10,Ffor areas of the UK which have seen
OL,11,Fprolonged dry weather, although
OL,12,Frainfall amounts are likely to be
OL,13,Ffairly modest. Just a low chance of a
OL,14,Fdeeper area of low pressure which
OL,15,Fwould bring more widespread and
OL,16,Fheavier rain along with some strong
OL,17,Fwinds. Beyond that it will likely
OL,18,Fbecome mostly dry once again as we
OL,19,Fhead toward mid-August. Temperatures
OL,20,Fcloser to average, still the potential
OL,21,Ffor some warmer interludes, especially
OL,22,Fin the south, although perhaps not the
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,23,Fheat we have seen in recent weeks.
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,164,160,301,260,100,100
